# New Marketing Page Checklist

A page that exists but is not registered everywhere below is NOT done. Orphan pages waste crawl budget and rank for nothing.

## Mandatory registrations

1. `metadata.<namespace>` (title + description) in `messages/en.json` AND `messages/ar.json`
2. Content namespace with full copy in BOTH message files
3. Sitemap entry in `src/app/sitemap.ts` (`staticPages` array)
4. `src/app/llms.txt/route.ts`: add the page to the matching section (Product, Business types, Free tools)
5. Internal links: `src/config/navigation.ts` (footer section, header nav if it is a hub) plus the matching `navigation.*` and `footer.*` label keys in both message files
6. Breadcrumb + WebPage JSON-LD (shells do this automatically; hand-built pages must add them)

## Reuse shells, do not hand-assemble

| Page type | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Industry landing page | `IndustryPageShell` (`src/features/industries/`) |
| Free tool page | `ToolPageShell` (`src/features/tools/`) |
| Hub/collection page | Follow `src/app/[locale]/industries/page.tsx` |
| Feature deep-dive | Follow `src/app/[locale]/features/free-pos/page.tsx` |

## Verify

Run `npm run type-check` and `npm run build`. Confirm the URL appears in the built sitemap and the page renders in both `/` and `/ar` variants.
